        "payload": "tree d5f561cd298622af191c7f729543f2ef0d05f2da\nparent 01c1f6f82a003a7aaca7a8fbd010d7218fd334c1\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1757511256 +0200\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1757583662 +0200\n\napp: fix sigint hanging\n\nWhen the node notifier was replaced with batcher, we removed\nits closing, but forgot to add the batchers so it was never\nstopping node connections and waiting forever.\n\nFixes #2751\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com>\n",
